          <h3 class={h3Class}>Work So Far</h3>
          <p>The DAO has accomplished several major tasks so far.</p>
          <ul class="space-y-4">
            <li class="flex gap-3">
              <span class="text-pink/70 shrink-0">—</span>
              <span>
                <strong class="text-cream-warm">Fundraise.</strong> The
